# No Cursor commit attribution

Never add `Co-authored-by: Cursor`, `Co-authored-by: cursoragent@cursor.com`, `Made-with: Cursor`, `Made with Cursor`, or any Cursor attribution trailer to commits, pull requests, or generated messages.

Commit as the repository author only. Do not mention Cursor in git metadata.
